Prior art and test oracle
--------------------------
Khac is an independent Swift implementation. Its natural-language parsing
behavior is informed by, and its test suite is validated against, the test
cases of chrono (https://github.com/wanasit/chrono), which is MIT licensed.
Locale vocabulary for languages not natively validated by this project draws
on chrono's locale data. Khac does not copy chrono's source code; it
reimplements the behavior with an independent, data-driven architecture.
